{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-02",
  "title": "破解锤砧战术",
  "storyCode": "14-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cea35dd15ed4ad5a10da801a7ee3f55bfedba1e7802e5b46ed42bdf02126005b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行动开始后二十三小时"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "前进路线清扫完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "text": "我正在侦察萨卡兹的动向，暂时没有发现他们留下的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "感谢你，Misery先生，请继续布置哨位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "摩根，你那边有没有发现活着的维多利亚士兵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "除了源石结晶，什么都没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "在进入西途林地以后，我们没有遇到哪怕一支维多利亚人的队伍，连尸体和载具残骸都几乎见不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "text": "见鬼！明明看起来打得这么激烈，人都上哪去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "text": "这里的地形还在一刻不停地变化，也许是......大地吃掉了一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我们不能低估人们的顽强。正因为有不愿放弃的人，才会有典范军。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我们也才会在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "希勒少尉，请继续让医疗兵做好接收残军和平民的准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "text": "我们的物资还算是有些富余，这方面可以放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "text": "但，坏消息是，鉴于现在队伍里感染者的数量，我们就快区分不了感染者士兵和非感染者士兵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我需要你的专业意见。登记感染者还能不能帮到我们的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "text": "哈哈。“登记感染者”......这几乎是我在军校学到的第一课。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "text": "但情况摆在这里了。我得说，意义不大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "好。那就别再登记了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "所有人，无论是否已经感染，都尽量按照罗德岛的建议做好防护。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "剩下的......就不是我们当前能决定的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "先活着打赢眼前这场仗。未来的仗，未来再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "啊，我的无人机回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛克十八",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "......糟透了，整个动力系统里都卡满了结晶粉尘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "看监测仪的数据，环境中源石浓度的涨落还是非常剧烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "洛洛，把最新的数据发给我，我们又迭代了一版活性化源石发展趋势的模型，看看这次的演算结果能不能拟合得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "啧，看来数据量还是不够，这个曲线的走势......等维克多他们那里衍射仪的分析报告出来，我们应该就能实时计算出安全区的位置了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "这片鬼地方，也许上一秒看起来风平浪静，下一秒就会从地里长出什么恐怖的源石大山。安全区的位置一直在变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "现在虽然短距离的通讯已经勉强恢复，但是距离稍微长一点，通讯还是会有干扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "多亏我有先见之明，在来伦蒂尼姆之前，找Raidian讨了她的施术单元，稍微仿制了一下......效果虽然不如正版，但够帮上忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "等到我们的几座便携通讯塔都竖起来，安全区的地点就能发送给战场上每一个有需要的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "这个信息能救很多人的命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "当然，我们罗德岛就是干这个的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "号角小姐，情况怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我们已经成功登陆吉布森镇。这里是我们进入银石崖前线之前的最后一个补给点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "侦察小队进行了初步的探索，确认有公爵联军残留的痕迹，他们应该是在数天前途经这里开赴前线的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”之前同步给我们的行进方向确实是安全的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "镇子上有停留人员吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "街道上是空的，但我能察觉到晃动的人影和食物的气息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我们没有贸然接触，以免产生不必要的误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "知道了，我们会尽快与你们会合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "天快黑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "看来，如果一切顺利，我们的战士还能稍作休息，喝上一碗热汤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "记得给我的人留点，他们忙完再赶回来还要点时间。洛洛和我也还得去费斯特那里一趟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "今天晚上说不定能把通讯范围再扩大一倍，我们争取尽早完工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "放心，我们一定把最好的菜留给你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......反正也就是罐头军粮吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "要不要抽点战车里的机油给你当佐料？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王＆洛洛",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "各队伍注意，继续前进，进入吉布森镇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "希望这一夜......可以和现在一样平静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "所有的房子看起来都没人，原本的居民都躲起来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "吉布森镇离公爵们的防线不远，应该没有被萨卡兹完全占领过，更何况联军几天前才通过了这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "但号角小姐的谨慎是对的，也许有之前掉队的公爵残部因为想追上大部队而进入这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "我们虽然收到了“灰礼帽”的建议，但维多利亚向来不是铁板一块。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "而且，典范军内部的情况还相当复杂，有些古板的军事贵族未必能容忍我们的存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "展示出我们的规模能让居心叵测的人先掂量掂量自己，也能让需要援助的人知道我们来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "战车行驶的声音回荡在沉默的夜色中，引擎的低鸣沉稳而有力。\n战士们小心地前进着，观察着四周，所见的依然只有一扇扇漆黑的窗户与门洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "看来他们不想主动与我们接触。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "也好，如果能相安无事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "等等，有声音，左前方的建筑里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "是炮弹弹壳落地的声音！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "埋伏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "大家戒备，我带人去探路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "第一、第二小队，跟上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "已经废弃的工厂里，没有半点人影。\n弹壳落地的声音消失后，也没有预想的爆炸声传来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "号角小姐，你确定那是弹壳落地的声音吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我很确定，而且，那是维多利亚精锐部队才会配给的特殊型号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "这里没有发现有人生活的痕迹——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "推进之王，停步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王刚抬起的脚又小心地放回了原地。\n号角指向地面上微不可察的，一条细细的绊线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "藏得很好，这条绊线刚好被管道挡住，很难发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "诡雷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "不......没有连接爆炸装置，是个简易的报警系统。但看设置的手法，是专业的军事人员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "尝试交流看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "嗯，站在我们后面，其他人，做好作战准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "你好，我们没有恶意——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "我们这支部队的番号是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "暗门！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "准备进入，跟住盾牌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我们不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵？",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵？",
      "text": "帮、帮帮我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "我就是在观察的时候不小心碰掉了楼上的废弹壳，这他们都听得到！你设置的报警器他们也没撞上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "这支队伍，恐怕不是那些一般的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "她......她能挡开你的破城矛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "队长？还有推进之王？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......菲奥娜，真的是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红色长发的姑娘猛然扑进她的队长的怀中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "原来，你们都还活着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "太好了，真的太好了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "号角轻轻松开了风笛，却又捏了捏她的肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "还好，没受伤，也没瘦多少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "报、报告队长！我做到了，我把鬼魂部队的情报带了出去，我还查清楚了他们到底想干什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "我活了下来，带着记忆，带着真相，一直活着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "你的命令......我一个字都没忘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "很好，我知道你能做到，从来都知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "——风笛，欢迎归队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "这是......？你们到底——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "各位，都请出来吧，我们没有恶意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个个人影从黑暗中走了出来。\n老人，孩子，伤员，病人，平民。\n成百上千双眼睛带着畏惧与好奇打量着推进之王等人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "你们不是公爵的部队？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的士兵",
      "text": "你、你们不少人没穿维多利亚的军装，怎么还有工人打扮的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "是的，我们不隶属于任何一位公爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "这支部队的番号是，“典范军”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "希勒少尉正在统计藏在工厂里的平民的人数和身体情况。只能说，比我们预计的要好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "除了和你一起过来的那些法夫公爵的感染者残兵，还有一小队诺曼底公爵的工兵，其他都是本地的平民，没跑得掉的那些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "明明公爵的联军前几天刚经过这里，他们却宁愿放弃可能被救援的机会，也不愿意寻求大公爵们的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "text": "军人们还好理解，无论是担心自己的感染状况，还是担心军事条令的处罚，都算是有个理由。可是平民们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "text": "这一年，也许伦蒂尼姆周围的人们，被迫重新认识了自己的国家和那些挂着勋章的上位者们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "风笛，你是怎么获得他们的信任——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......你在听吗，风笛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "啊，队长！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "开战术会议的时候需要聚精会神。地图在那里，不在我脸上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "抱歉，队长！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "号角轻轻叹了口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......唉，这问题我不该问，毕竟你可是菲奥娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "我就是......有点高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "“典范军”，风暴突击队的前身。原来那些传言是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......我比较惊讶的是，你居然没忘记军史课的内容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "当然啦！以前在驻地受训的时候，三角铁可是监督我把这条罚抄了好多遍呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "驻地的操场边上，岩槭长得很茂密，挡太阳正好，外面崖壁上的石头很硬，磨得手疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我记得，有一回大提琴和双簧管打赌，谁能更快完成攀岩训练，输的人做一百个单手俯卧撑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "双簧管太傻了，谁会跟大提琴打这种赌啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "你那时候可没提醒他。他做俯卧撑的时候，你还坐他背上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "嘿嘿。我那是，帮他加练。效果不是还不错吗？他后来差点就打败大提琴了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "早在风暴突击队成立的时候，那支四国战争时期的传奇部队就连一个空番号都不剩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "但是现在，它又回到了这片战场上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "风笛，我们现在都是典范军的一员了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我们的队伍还在，我们就不会停止战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "里面不是在开作战会议吗？你怎么在外面的冷风里站着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "嗯......不差这几分钟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "......想起谁了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "贝尔德，还是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "谁都没想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "我信你。要是这夜雾里突然走过来一个人，我也并不会有什么期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "不是谁都有号角小姐那么幸运，还能和自己最想见的人......重逢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "“幸运”吗？真是个奢侈的词啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......伤感的时间到此为止，我们也该进去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "维多利亚的军人？是留在这里的残兵吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "不，不对，在他们接近之前，我居然都没发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "这种素质......精锐中的精锐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "开斯特的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......呵——真冷啊，手都冻僵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这天啊，真是越来越冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "只是散了这一会儿步，披肩就差不多湿了一半。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "text": "年轻的朋友们，真的不准备邀请我进去暖和一下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......既然您愿意亲自出马，那我们也该有些礼貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "戴菲恩——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "维娜小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我们来为公爵大人引路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
